    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397510/extras/e4a98f81393322b47f923296766b31ab.poster.avif?t=1737154956\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397510/extras/e4a98f81393322b47f923296766b31ab.webm?t=1737154956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397510/extras/e4a98f81393322b47f923296766b31ab.mp4?t=1737154956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find 100 hidden tomatoes scattered across a vibrant 3D city. Explore detailed urban areas with colorful graphics that bring the streets, buildings, and alleys to life.<br><br>With relaxing music and a calm atmosphere, enjoy uncovering each tomato at your own pace in this visually stunning environment.<br> <br>Gameplay: <br>\ud83c\udf45 1 Level, 100 hidden tomatoes in a city setting.   <br>\ud83d\udc49 Click on the tomatoes you find.<br>\ud83d\udca1 Hint System <br> <br>Features: <br>- Explore a lively city with beautifully designed urban landscape.   <br>- No time limits\u2014take your time and enjoy the hunt.   <br>- Fun and challenging for players of all ages. <br> <br>Can you find all the hidden tomatoes in the city? Start your adventure now!",
